<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>HTML Formatting Test Document</title>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #222;
    background: #ffffff;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 40px;
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .cover {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 45px 20px;
    border: 3px solid #222;
    margin-bottom: 35px;
  }
  .cover h1 {
    font-size: 38px;
    margin: 0 0 15px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .cover .subtitle {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .cover .description {
    margin: 25px auto 0;
    max-width: 800px;
  }
  h2 {
    color: #245a94;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #245a94;
    padding-bottom: 6px;
    margin-top: 38px;
  }
  h3 {
    color: #555;
  }
  .mixed span { margin-right: 5px; }
  .red { color: #c00000; }
  .green { color: #008000; }
  .blue { color: #0050b4; }
  .orange { color: #e07800; }
  .highlight { background: #ffff00; }
  .small { font-size: 10px; }
  .medium { font-size: 16px; }
  .large { font-size: 24px; }
  .xl { font-size: 32px; }
  .quote {
    border-left: 5px solid #777;
    background: #f3f3f3;
    padding: 15px 20px;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  .warning {
    text-align: center;
    color: #b40000;
    font-weight: bold;
    padding: 15px;
    border: 2px solid #b40000;
    background: #fff3f3;
  }
  .box {
    border: 1px solid #555;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  .box-title {
    background: #fff2cc;
    font-weight: bold;
    padding: 8px;
  }
  .box-content {
    padding: 12px;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #333;
    padding: 9px;
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  th {
    background: #d9eaf7;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .merged {
    background: #e2f0d9;
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .center { text-align: center; }
  .right { text-align: right; }
  .justify { text-align: justify; }
  .indent {
    text-indent: 40px;
  }
  .spaced {
    margin-top: 25px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    line-height: 2;
  }
  .code {
    font-family: Consolas, "Courier New", monospace;
    background: #eeeeee;
    padding: 2px 5px;
  }
  pre {
    background: #f4f4f4;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    padding: 15px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .two-column {
    column-count: 2;
    column-gap: 45px;
  }
  .rtl {
    direction: rtl;
    text-align: right;
    border: 1px solid #bbb;
    padding: 15px;
  }
  .small-table {
    max-width: 650px;
  }
  .footer-test {
    margin-top: 50px;
    padding-top: 15px;
    border-top: 2px solid #222;
    text-align: center;
    color: #666;
  }
  .svg-wrap {
    border: 1px solid #aaa;
    padding: 15px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  @media print {
    .page-break { page-break-before: always; }
  }
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="container">

  <section class="cover">
    <h1>HTML FORMATTING TEST DOCUMENT</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">Localization / Translation Tool Validation Suite</div>
    <p class="description">
      This document intentionally contains diverse HTML formatting, structures, tables,
      lists, symbols, inline styles, CSS properties, technical tokens, and multilingual content.
      Use it to test parsing, translation, segmentation, formatting preservation, and export fidelity.
    </p>
  </section>

  <h2>1. Typography and Inline Formatting</h2>
  <p class="mixed">
    <strong>Bold text</strong> |
    <em>Italic text</em> |
    <u>Underlined text</u> |
    <strong><em>Bold + Italic</em></strong> |
    <s>Strikethrough</s> |
    <mark>Highlighted text</mark> |
    <small>Small text</small> |
    <sup>Superscript 102</sup> |
    <sub>Subscript H₂O</sub> |
    <span style="font-variant: small-caps;">Small Caps</span>
  </p>

  <p>
    <span class="red">Red</span>
    <span class="green">Green</span>
    <span class="blue">Blue</span>
    <span class="orange">Orange</span>
  </p>

  <p>
    Mixed font sizes:
    <span class="small">8pt</span>
    <span class="medium">16pt</span>
    <span class="large">24pt</span>
    <span class="xl">32pt</span>
  </p>

  <p>
    Special characters:
    © ® ™ € £ ¥ ₹ § ¶ † ‡ • … — – « » “ ” ‘ ’
  </p>

  <p>
    Math / Unicode:
    α β γ Δ Ω μ π √ ∑ ∞ ≠ ≤ ≥ ± × ÷ → ← ↔ ∀ ∃ ∈ ∉
  </p>

  <h2>2. Paragraph Alignment and Spacing</h2>

  <p style="text-align:left;">
    <strong>Left aligned:</strong> This paragraph tests left alignment and normal text wrapping.
  </p>

  <p class="center">
    <strong>Centered:</strong> This paragraph tests centered alignment.
  </p>

  <p class="right">
    <strong>Right aligned:</strong> This paragraph tests right alignment.
  </p>

  <p class="justify">
    <strong>Justified:</strong> This paragraph contains enough text to test justified alignment,
    word spacing, line wrapping, and the behavior of translated text when sentence length changes
    significantly between source and target languages.
  </p>

  <p class="indent">
    First-line indentation test. This paragraph intentionally begins with an indented first line.
    It should preserve indentation and paragraph spacing after translation.
  </p>

  <p class="spaced">
    Paragraph spacing and line-height test. This text intentionally has increased line spacing and
    larger margins before and after the paragraph.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Lists</h2>

  <h3>Unordered List</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Primary translation</li>
    <li>Quality assurance</li>
    <li>Glossary validation</li>
    <li>Formatting preservation</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Ordered List</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>Upload source</li>
    <li>Extract content</li>
    <li>Translate content</li>
    <li>Rebuild document</li>
    <li>Validate output</li>
  </ol>

  <h3>Nested List</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Main item A
      <ul>
        <li>Nested item 1</li>
        <li>Nested item 2</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Main item B
      <ol>
        <li>Nested numbered item 1</li>
        <li>Nested numbered item 2</li>
      </ol>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Quotes and Callouts</h2>

  <blockquote class="quote">
    “The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.”
  </blockquote>

  <div class="warning">
    IMPORTANT: This is a centered warning/callout sentence.
  </div>

  <div class="box">
    <div class="box-title">NOTICE</div>
    <div class="box-content">
      This bordered box tests nested elements, background colors, borders, padding, and
      preservation of block-level structure.
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>5. Tables</h2>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>ID</th>
        <th>Source Text</th>
        <th>Target Text</th>
        <th>Status</th>
        <th>Score</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>001</td>
        <td>Hello, world!</td>
        <td>नमस्ते, दुनिया!</td>
