        <td>100%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>002</td>
        <td>Good morning.</td>
        <td>सुप्रभात।</td>
        <td>Review</td>
        <td>92%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>003</td>
        <td>Translation memory</td>
        <td>अनुवाद मेमोरी</td>
        <td>Approved</td>
        <td>98%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>004</td>
        <td>Formatting test</td>
        <td>फ़ॉर्मेटिंग परीक्षण</td>
        <td>Pending</td>
        <td>—</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <table class="small-table">
    <tr>
      <th colspan="4" class="merged">Merged Header — colspan=4</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>A</th>
      <th>B</th>
      <th>C</th>
      <th>D</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Long text that wraps across the cell</td>
      <td>12345</td>
      <td>₹10,000</td>
      <td>✓</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h2>6. Links, Emails, URLs and Special Tokens</h2>

  <p>
    Website:
    <a href="https://example.com/translation/test?lang=en&amp;target=hi">
      https://example.com/translation/test?lang=en&amp;target=hi
    </a>
  </p>

  <p>Email: <a href="mailto:test@example.com">test@example.com</a></p>

  <p>
    Tokens:
    <span class="code">${USER_NAME}</span> |
    <span class="code">{{count}}</span> |
    <span class="code">%PLACEHOLDER%</span> |
    <span class="code">&lt;g id="1"/&gt;</span> |
    <span class="code">[DO_NOT_TRANSLATE]</span>
  </p>

  <h2>7. Technical Content</h2>

  <p>
    Inline code:
    <code>const result = await translateText("Hello world", "en", "hi");</code>
  </p>

  <pre><code>function translateText(text, source, target) {
  return {
    source: source,
    target: target,
    text: text
  };
}</code></pre>

  <h2>8. Two-Column Layout</h2>

  <div class="two-column">
    <p>
      This section uses CSS columns. The translation tool should preserve the two-column
      structure rather than converting the content into a single uncontrolled block.
    </p>
    <p>
      This is additional content to force column flow and test how translated text affects
      column balancing and pagination.
    </p>
    <p>
      Long translated sentences may become substantially longer than the source. This makes
      column preservation an important formatting test.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="page-break">9. Multilingual and RTL Content</h2>

  <p>
    <strong>English:</strong>
    The translation system must preserve formatting while adapting sentence length to the target language.
  </p>

  <p>
    <strong>Hindi:</strong>
    अनुवाद प्रणाली को लक्ष्य भाषा के अनुसार वाक्य की लंबाई को समायोजित करते हुए फ़ॉर्मेटिंग को सुरक्षित रखना चाहिए।
  </p>

  <p>
    <strong>Gujarati:</strong>
    અનુવાદ પ્રણાલીએ લક્ષ્ય ભાષા અનુસાર વાક્યની લંબાઈને સમાયોજિત કરતી વખતે ફોર્મેટિંગ જાળવી રાખવું જોઈએ.
  </p>

  <div class="rtl">
    <strong>Arabic:</strong>
    يجب أن يحافظ نظام الترجمة على التنسيق مع تكييف طول الجمل وفقًا للغة الهدف.
  </div>

  <h2>10. Images / SVG Test</h2>

  <div class="svg-wrap">
    <svg width="500" height="180" viewBox="0 0 500 180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-label="Formatting test graphic">
      <rect x="10" y="10" width="480" height="160" fill="#e8f1f8" stroke="#245a94" stroke-width="3"/>
      <circle cx="100" cy="90" r="50" fill="#f4b183"/>
      <rect x="180" y="45" width="100" height="90" fill="#a9d18e"/>
      <text x="310" y="85" font-family="Arial" font-size="20" font-weight="bold">SVG TEST</text>
      <text x="310" y="115" font-family="Arial" font-size="14">Do not translate this graphic</text>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <h2>11. Form Elements</h2>

  <form>
    <label for="name"><strong>Name:</strong></label>
    <input id="name" type="text" value="Translation Tester">

    <label for="language"><strong>Language:</strong></label>
    <select id="language">
      <option>English</option>
      <option>Hindi</option>
      <option>Gujarati</option>
      <option>Arabic</option>
    </select>

    <label>
      <input type="checkbox" checked>
      Preserve formatting
    </label>

    <label>
      <input type="radio" name="status" checked>
      Approved
    </label>
  </form>

  <h2>12. Translation QA Checklist</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>☐ Headings remain headings.</li>
    <li>☐ Bold, italic, underline, and colors are preserved.</li>
    <li>☐ Tables retain rows, columns, borders, and merged cells.</li>
    <li>☐ Lists preserve numbering and nesting.</li>
    <li>☐ Special characters and symbols remain intact.</li>
    <li>☐ Variables, tags, and placeholders are not translated.</li>
    <li>☐ URLs and email addresses remain intact.</li>
    <li>☐ CSS alignment and spacing remain correct.</li>
    <li>☐ RTL content remains right-to-left.</li>
    <li>☐ Images/SVG graphics remain unchanged.</li>
    <li>☐ Long translated text does not overlap nearby content.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>13. Stress-Test Paragraph</h2>

  <p>
    This is an intentionally long paragraph for translation and HTML reconstruction testing.
    It contains punctuation, numbers (1234567890), currency values (₹10,000, €500, $250),
    abbreviations (API, HTML, CSS, JS), technical tokens (${variable}, {{count}}, &lt;g id="1"/&gt;),
    an email address (test@example.com), a URL (https://example.com), and a
    verylongunbrokenwordthatmayforcewrappingbehaviorintherenderer. The purpose is to test
    segmentation, whitespace preservation, inline elements, escaping, line wrapping, and
    formatting fidelity after translation.
  </p>

  <div class="footer-test">
    HTML FORMATTING TEST — END OF DOCUMENT
  </div>

</div>
